{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"一、三年，春王正月，溺會齊師伐衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"溺者何？吾大夫之未命者也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"二、夏四月，葬宋莊公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"三、五月，葬桓王。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"此未有言崩者，何以書葬？蓋改葬也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"四、秋，紀季以酅入于齊。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"紀季者何？紀侯之弟也。何以不名？賢也。何賢乎紀季？服罪也。其服罪奈何？魯子曰：「請後五廟以存姑姊妹。」","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"五、冬，公次于郎。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_32_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_32","textTraditional":"其言公次于郎何？刺欲救紀而後不能也。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}